        "trs": "‎‎I have caused sins (sinned), I confess myself.  I hold all, we, God, holiest Maria always a virgin, Archangel Michael, the Baptist, Jose, the saints, Peter (of the) gate, Pablo, all the saints of Heaven, and I you also, the Padre confesses me to you, I made (someone) do a lot of evil, by thoughts, by the heart, by words, by deeds also, I just ???, I just ??? a lot.",
